flowchart LR
  COPY[POST /v1/copy or COPY/LOAD DATA SQL] --> Validate[File path/options/limits validation]
  Validate --> Reader[CSV or JSON streaming reader]
  Reader --> Convert[Column resolution and typed conversion]
  Convert --> Batch[Bounded batch]
  Batch --> Commit[One transaction per batch]
  Commit -->|success| Next{More records?}
  Commit -->|first error| Stop[Stop; report error class and committed rows]
  Next -->|yes| Batch
  Next -->|no| Done[Load complete]
